      "message": "fix(post): refuse a C rewind when the machine states a C travel but no C rate\n\nA machine file whose rotary C states a travel but no rate (feed or\nrapid) left the C rewind orbit of #860 uncapped: the lathe post scaled\nthe machine's max linear feed by the C turn (~57 x fmax / r). Rotary\nContour now refuses the rewind by name at generation, and the lathe\npost refuses any C-turning rapid on such a machine, so no F the file\nnever stated is posted. Decision in docs/decisions/906-c-unwind-rate-cap.md.\n\nFixes #906\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>",
